   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 蛋白质结构预测工作流\n",
    "\n",
    "**主要功能：**\n",
    "- 从 `.gbk` 文件提取蛋白质CDS序列\n",
    "- 使用 ESM3 进行蛋白质结构预测\n",
    "- 生成标准PDB格式文件\n",
    "\n",
    "**输入：**\n",
    "- GenBank文件 (`.gbk`, `.gbff`)\n",
    "- 或蛋白质序列文件 (`.faa`, `.fa`, `.fasta`)\n",
    "\n",
    "**输出：**\n",
    "- 预测的结构文件 (PDB格式)\n",
    "- 结构预测报告\n",
    "\n",
    "**系统要求：**\n",
    "- JupyterLab/JupyterHub 服务器环境\n",
    "- GPU 推荐用于加速结构预测\n",
    "- 约 10-20 GB 磁盘空间"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 环境设置与依赖安装"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# 项目根目录\n",
    "PROJECT_ROOT = Path(os.environ.get('PROTFLOW_ROOT', Path.cwd())).resolve()\n",
    "WORK_DIR = PROJECT_ROOT / 'structure_prediction_runs'\n",
    "WORK_DIR.mkdir(exist_ok=True, parents=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"工作目录: {WORK_DIR}\")\n",
    "print(f\"项目根目录: {PROJECT_ROOT}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 安装必要的Python包\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "def install_package(package):\n",
    "    \"\"\"安装Python包\"\"\"\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        __import__(package)\n",
    "        print(f\"✓ {package} 已安装\")\n",
    "    except ImportError:\n",
    "        print(f\"正在安装 {package}...\")\n",
    "        subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", package])\n",
    "\n",
    "# 安装依赖\n",
    "packages = [\"torch\", \"biopython\", \"tqdm\", \"huggingface_hub\", \"pandas\", \"numpy\"]\n",
    "for pkg in packages:\n",
    "    install_package(pkg)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 安装ESM3模型"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 安装ESM3\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    import esm\n",
    "    print(\"✓ ESM3 已安装\")\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    print(\"正在安装 ESM3...\")\n",
    "    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"esm\", \"--no-deps\"])\n",
    "    print(\"✓ ESM3 安装完成\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 文件输入\n",
    "\n",
    "支持以下输入格式：\n",
    "- GenBank文件 (.gbk, .gbff)\n",
    "- 蛋白质序列文件 (.faa, .fa, .fasta)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from Bio import SeqIO\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "def extract_protein_sequences(input_file):\n",
    "    \"\"\"从输入文件提取蛋白质序列\"\"\"\n",
    "    input_path = Path(input_file)\n",
    "    sequences = []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if input_path.suffix in ['.gbk', '.gbff']:\n",
    "        # 从GenBank文件提取CDS\n",
    "        print(f\"正在从GenBank文件提取蛋白质序列: {input_path.name}\")\n",
    "        with open(input_path, 'r') as handle:\n",
    "            for record in SeqIO.parse(handle, \"genbank\"):\n",
    "                for feature in record.features:\n",
    "                    if feature.type == 'CDS':\n",
    "                        if 'translation' in feature.qualifiers:\n",
    "                            protein_id = feature.qualifiers.get('protein_id', ['unknown'])[0]\n",
    "                            product = feature.qualifiers.get('product', ['unknown'])[0]\n",
    "                            sequence = feature.qualifiers['translation'][0]\n",
    "                            sequences.append({\n",
    "                                'id': protein_id,\n",
    "                                'description': product,\n",
    "                                'sequence': sequence\n",
    "                            })\n",
    "    elif input_path.suffix in ['.faa', '.fa', '.fasta']:\n",
    "        # 直接读取蛋白质序列文件\n",
    "        print(f\"正在读取蛋白质序列文件: {input_path.name}\")\n",
    "        with open(input_path, 'r') as handle:\n",
    "            for record in SeqIO.parse(handle, \"fasta\"):\n",
    "                sequences.append({\n",
    "                    'id': record.id,\n",
    "                    'description': record.description,\n",
    "                    'sequence': str(record.seq)\n",
    "                })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"✓ 共提取 {len(sequences)} 个蛋白质序列\")\n",
    "    return sequences\n",
    "\n",
    "# 示例：请替换为您的文件路径\n",
    "input_file = \"path/to/your/file.gbk\"  # 或 .faa, .fa, .fasta\n",
    "protein_sequences = extract_protein_sequences(input_file)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 蛋白质结构预测\n",
    "\n",
    "使用ESM3进行结构预测"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import torch\n",
    "from tqdm import tqdm\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "def predict_structures(sequences, output_dir, model_name='esm3-open-small'):\n",
    "    \"\"\"使用ESM3预测蛋白质结构\"\"\"\n",
    "    output_path = Path(output_dir)\n",
    "    output_path.mkdir(exist_ok=True, parents=True)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"使用模型: {model_name}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"输出目录: {output_path}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 检查GPU可用性\n",
    "    device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n",
    "    print(f\"使用设备: {device}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "        print(f\"GPU型号: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")\n",
    "        print(f\"显存: {torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / 1024**3:.1f} GB\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 加载模型\n",
    "    print(\"正在加载ESM3模型...\")\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        from esm import ESM3InferenceClient\n",
    "        model = ESM3InferenceClient.from_pretrained(model_name).to(device)\n",
    "        print(\"✓ 模型加载成功\")\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        print(f\"❌ 模型加载失败: {e}\")\n",
    "        return []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    results = []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 预测结构\n",
    "    for seq_info in tqdm(sequences, desc=\"预测结构\"):\n",
    "        try:\n",
    "            sequence = seq_info['sequence']\n",
    "            protein_id = seq_info['id']\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 检查序列长度\n",
    "            if len(sequence) > 1000:\n",
    "                print(f\"⚠️ 跳过 {protein_id}: 序列过长 ({len(sequence)} > 1000)\")\n",
    "                continue\n",
    "            \n",
    "            if len(sequence) < 30:\n",
    "                print(f\"⚠️ 跳过 {protein_id}: 序列过短 ({len(sequence)} < 30)\")\n",
    "                continue\n",
    "            \n",
    "            print(f\"正在预测 {protein_id} (长度: {len(sequence)})...\")\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 进行预测\n",
    "            with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "                output = model.predict_structure(sequence)\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 保存PDB文件\n",
    "            pdb_file = output_path / f\"{protein_id}.pdb\"\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 保存结构（这里需要根据实际的ESM3输出格式调整）\n",
",
    "            if hasattr(output, 'save_pdb'):\n",
    "                output.save_pdb(str(pdb_file))\n",
    "            else:\n",
    "                # 简单保存为PDB格式\n",
    "                with open(pdb_file, 'w') as f:\n",
    "                    f.write(str(output))\n",
    "            \n",
    "            results.append({\n",
    "                'protein_id': protein_id,\n",
    "                'description': seq_info['description'],\n",
    "                'sequence_length': len(sequence),\n",
    "                'pdb_file': str(pdb_file),\n",
    "                'status': 'success'\n",
    "            })\n",
    "            \n",
    "            print(f\"✓ {protein_id} 预测完成\")\n",
    "            \n",
    "        except Exception as e:\n",
    "            print(f\"❌ {protein_id} 预测失败: {e}\")\n",
    "            results.append({\n",
    "                'protein_id': protein_id,\n",
    "                'description': seq_info['description'],\n",
    "                'sequence_length': len(seq_info['sequence']),\n",
    "                'pdb_file': None,\n",
    "                'status': f'failed: {e}'\n",
    "            })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"✓ 结构预测完成，共成功 {len([r for r in results if r['status'] == 'success'])} 个\")\n",
    "    return results\n",
    "\n",
    "# 运行结构预测\n",
    "pdb_output_dir = WORK_DIR / 'predicted_structures'\n",
    "prediction_results = predict_structures(protein_sequences, pdb_output_dir)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 结果汇总与可视化"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 生成结果报告\n",
    "results_df = pd.DataFrame(prediction_results)\n",
    "print(\"=== 结构预测结果汇总 ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"总蛋白质数: {len(results_df)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"预测成功: {len(results_df[results_df['status'] == 'success'])}\")\n",
    "print(f\"预测失败: {len(results_df[results_df['status'] != 'success'])}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 保存结果\n",
    "results_file = WORK_DIR / 'prediction_summary.csv'\n",
    "results_df.to_csv(results_file, index=False)\n",
    "print(f\"\\n结果已保存: {results_file}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 显示成功预测的统计信息\n",
    "if len(results_df[results_df['status'] == 'success']) > 0:\n",
    "    successful = results_df[results_df['status'] == 'success']\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n成功预测的平均序列长度: {successful['sequence_length'].mean():.1f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"序列长度范围: {successful['sequence_length'].min()} - {successful['sequence_length'].max()}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 显示前几个成功的预测\n",
    "    print(\"\\n前5个成功预测:\")\n",
    "    print(successful[['protein_id', 'description', 'sequence_length']].head())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 结构质量评估"
",
    "（可选）对预测的结构进行质量评估"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def assess_structure_quality(pdb_file):\n",
    "    \"\"\"简单评估PDB文件质量\"\"\"\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        from Bio.PDB import PDBParser\n",
    "        parser = PDBParser()\n",
    "        structure = parser.get_structure('temp', pdb_file)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 统计信息\n",
    "        num_residues = len(list(structure.get_residues()))\n",
    "        num_atoms = len(list(structure.get_atoms()))\n",
    "        \n",
    "        return {\n",
    "            'file': str(pdb_file),\n",
    "            'residues': num_residues,\n",
    "            'atoms': num_atoms,\n",
    "            'status': 'ok'\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        return {\n",
    "            'file': str(pdb_file),\n",
    "            'residues': 0,\n",
    "            'atoms': 0,\n",
    "            'status': f'error: {e}'\n",
    "        }\n",
    "\n",
    "# 评估预测的结构\n",
    "print(\"正在评估预测结构的质量...\")\n",
    "quality_results = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for result in prediction_results:\n",
    "    if result['status'] == 'success' and result['pdb_file']:\n",
    "        quality = assess_structure_quality(result['pdb_file'])\n",
    "        quality_results.append(quality)\n",
    "\n",
    "if quality_results:\n",
    "    quality_df = pd.DataFrame(quality_results)\n",
    "    print(f\"评估完成，平均残基数: {quality_df['residues'].mean():.1f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"评估完成，平均原子数: {quality_df['atoms'].mean():.1f}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 保存质量评估结果\n",
    "    quality_file = WORK_DIR / 'structure_quality.csv'\n",
    "    quality_df.to_csv(quality_file, index=False)\n",
    "    print(f\"质量评估结果保存: {quality_file}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 下一步操作\n",
    "\n",
    "完成结构预测后，您可以：\n",
