    "\n",
    "**结果文件位置:**\n",
    "- 预测结构: `{WORK_DIR}/predicted_structures/`\n",
    "- 结果汇总: `{WORK_DIR}/prediction_summary.csv`\n",
    "- 质量评估: `{WORK_DIR}/structure_quality.csv`"
   ]
